      "writtenOn": "2021-10-13T20:03:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Infact,I2C_CHAN_COUNT is based on typec ports + other i2c ports.\n\nIn board specific files, i2c_ports_used is getting assigned based on I2C_CHAN_COUNT. \nAlso , for microchip based board, the value that will get returned will be i2c_ports_used itself, as the flag - board_adl_m_n_rvp is not set .\n\nreference From boardlevl file on  default value taken:\nBUILD_ASSERT(ARRAY_SIZE(i2c_ports) \u003d\u003d I2C_CHAN_COUNT);\nconst unsigned int i2c_ports_used \u003d ARRAY_SIZE(i2c_ports);",
      "parentUuid": "f040a418_57f39596",
      "revId": "f57e372effec02f379eb7e4906ab75f27860bb6e",
